# gateway.py is the deployed cloud gateway source (also mirrored to the VPS).
# It is tracked on purpose: without it the published repo cannot run a gateway.
# Never commit registry.json or *.env next to it - those hold live tokens.
# Build output of build-installer-exe.ps1: the executable is published as a
# release asset, not committed.
dist/
